      ":question/worked-solution": "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P-Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & -6 & -11 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 9 \\\\ 11 & 11 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 9 & -1 \\\\ 12 & -10 & 6 \\\\ -1 & 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11-6 & -6-9 & -11-(-1) \\\\ 3-12 & -1-(-10) & 9-6 \\\\ 11-(-1) & 11-5 & -1-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-17 & -15 & -10 \\\\ -9 & 9 & 3 \\\\ 12 & 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
